OL,3,ABadenoch says proposed #10bn air
OL,4,Adefence system would be 'specific' to
OL,5,AUK threats as costs questioned
OL,6,
OL,7,FKemi Badenoch tells the BBC the
OL,8,FConservatives want to design an air
OL,9,Fdefence system "specific for the kind
OL,10,Fof threat" the UK faces
OL,12,FIt comes after her party said it would
OL,13,Fcreate a #10bn system named "Britannia
OL,14,FShield" - saying it was "in essence a
OL,15,FBritish 'Iron Dome'", referring to
OL,16,FIsrael's defence system
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
